{"id":"int-06f03b363e7f1e6239f2a6c5a362436d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-08T04:40:41.571715707Z","actor":"Isaac Karrer","issue_id":"homelab-bqo.28","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Converted the real leaderboard.json touchpoints to atomic_json (ac-host commits e4238a7, 5f5066d): sidecar/plugin.py (the authoritative writer -- was silently persisting an empty board over a transient corrupt read, now fails loudly instead) plus bot.py and series_lib.py (read-only, now warn-and-degrade instead of masking corruption as an empty board). Note: 3 of the bead's originally-listed 8 files (ci_publish_pages.py, seed_github_env.py, push_status.py) turned out not to touch leaderboard.json's local JSON content at all, and server_health.py writes maintenance.json, not leaderboard.json -- no change applied to those four; see commit message for detail. 37+45 tests pass."}}
